### 1. Register New Patient
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Felobateer Wael",
  "username": "felo_test1",
  "email": "felo.test1@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "phone": "01012345678",
  "address": "10th of Ramadan City",
  "role": "patient",
  "bloodType": "O_Positive"
}

### 2. Register New Doctor
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dr. Sarah Johnson",
  "username": "dr_sarah",
  "email": "sarah.doc@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "phone": "01098765432",
  "role": "provider",
  "providerType": "Doctor",
  "specialization": "Cardiologist",
  "licenseNumber": "DOC-123456"
}

### 3. Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "felo.test1@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. Refresh Token
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "<REFRESH_TOKEN>"
}

### 5. Verify Email
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "<VERIFICATION_TOKEN>"
}

### 6. Resend Verification Email
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "felo.test1@gmail.com"
}

### 7. Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/forget-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "felo.test1@gmail.com"
}

### 8. Reset Password
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "<RESET_TOKEN>",
  "password": "NewPassword123!"
}

### 9. Get Current User Profile (/api/auth/me)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

### 10. Get User via Mounted User Router (/api/users/me)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

### 11. Update Profile (/api/auth/me)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Felobateer Wael Updated",
  "phone": "01099998888"
}

### 12. Google Auth URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/google-url

### 13. Logout
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>
